# Owner and manager in Russian: владелец, руководитель
subtitle: "Руководитель, владелец, производство: how Russian makes people and things from words you know with -тель, -ец and -ство, as Софья asks to join Tom."
tags: ["russian","word formation","russian suffixes","business russian","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/word-building","vocabulary/business"]
thumb: "band \"Owner, in Russian\" stamp \"-ЕЦ\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A Russian CV and cover letter: резюме, опыт, знания","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/199-russian-cv-cover-letter.cast"}

## Owner and manager in Russian: владелец, руководитель
